{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00880","headline":"鼓吹曲辞 芳树 · 徐彦伯","name":"鼓吹曲辞 芳树","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉花珍簟上，金缕画屏开。\n晓月怜筝柱，春风忆镜台。\n筝柱春风吹晓月，芳树落花朝暝歇。\n藳砧刀头未有时，攀条拭泪坐相思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐彦伯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00880.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00880","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}